Access Control System The residential elements of apartment blocks
hereby approved within the Detailed Application shall not be occupied until:&nbsp;(i)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
an
audio-visual access control system has been installed; or (ii)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
such
alternative security measures have been installed that shall first have been
submitted to, and agreed in writing by, the Local Planning Authority.REASON: To ensure that the development
achieves a high standard of residential quality for future occupiers of the
development&nbsp;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Time Limit 3 years - Full Permission (detailed element) &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The development pursuant
to the Detailed Element shall be begun before the expiration of three years
from the date of this permission.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Reserved Matters &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Approval of the details shown below (the Reserved Matters)
for each relevant phase of the outline of development shall be obtained from
the local planning authority in writing before any development in that phase is commenced:AccessAppearanceLandscapingLayout
